{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36988","headline":"途中送人东游有寄 · 罗隐","name":"途中送人东游有寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"离骖莫惜暂逡巡，君向池阳我入秦。\n岁月易抛非曩日，酒桮难得是同人。\n路经隋苑桥灯夜，江转台城岸草春。\n此处故交谁见问，爲言霜鬓压风尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36988.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36988","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}